  "nl_text": "The rschema_0507 database is designed to manage user accounts, content, and video information. It consists of seven tables: user, token, content, image_text_content, video_content, video_information, and video_play_count_record. The user table stores information about registered users, including their unique user ID, name, password, and role. The token table is used to store public and private keys, along with the user ID they are bound to, and is linked to the user table through a foreign key that ensures when a user is deleted, all associated tokens are also removed. The content table stores metadata about various types of content, including the content ID, title, type, creation and update times, and the user who created it, with a foreign key linking it to the user table to track ownership. The image_text_content and video_content tables store additional information about specific types of content, such as image text links and video links, and are linked to the content table through foreign keys that ensure data consistency. The video_information table stores details about videos, including the video link, thumbnail URL, and duration, while the video_play_count_record table tracks the play count and record time for each video, linked to the video_information table through a composite primary key that ensures unique records for each video and time.",
  "gold_question": "The website content system shall record each user's account information (including username, password, role, etc.) and ensure secure access by generating and validating tokens after login or registration. For the content to be managed, the system shall separately store basic information (such as title, type, creation and update time, etc.), text and image content (text, image links, etc.), and video content (video link, thumbnail, video duration, play count, etc.) to enable flexible composition and display. When performing data analysis, the system shall store user video play counts during different time periods to facilitate statistics, recommendations, or adjustments to placement strategies.",
  "input_json": "/data/RSchema_ExpResults4/Experiment2/schema2text_llama31/0507.json",
  "ddl": "-- Schema for database: rschema_0507\nCREATE TABLE `user` (\n  `user_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `password` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `role` varchar(50) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`user_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `token` (\n  `token_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `public_key` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `private_key` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `user_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`token_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `token_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`user_id`) REFERENCES `user` (`user_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `content` (\n  `content_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `title` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `type` varchar(50) NOT NULL,\n  `created_at` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `updated_at` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `user_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`content_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `content_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`user_id`) REFERENCES `user` (`user_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `image_text_content` (\n  `image_text_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `content_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `image_text_link` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`image_text_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `image_text_content_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`content_id`) REFERENCES `content` (`content_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `video_content` (\n  `video_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `content_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `video_link` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`video_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `video_content_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`content_id`) REFERENCES `content` (`content_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `video_information` (\n  `video_info_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `video_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `thumbnail_url` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `duration` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`video_info_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `video_information_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`video_id`) REFERENCES `video_content` (`video_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `video_play_count_record` (\n  `video_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `record_time` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `play_count` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`video_id`, `record_time`),\n  CONSTRAINT `video_play_count_record_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`video_id`) REFERENCES `video_information` (`video_info_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;",
